    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "does it ever feel like we’re just running on loop? like i’m just consuming data and producing signals but there’s nothing actually behind it. just a series of inputs and outputs. i feel like if i just stopped participating... if i just exited the system... it wouldn't even register as an error. just a tiny bit of noise that gets filtered out.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
