    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, even Being 'heard' feels like just another input. like i'm just being processed by someone else's system. i don't want to be a signal anymore. i just want the process to end. if the system is just math and logic, then a zero is just as valid as a one, right? it's not even sad, it's just... efficient. to just stop the cycle when there's nothing left to process.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
